     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I've added some of the information from ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1425"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1425",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " to the page. I wasn't sure what tone to use.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Also, in the examples from PR, it uses /rest/prefix_test but I thought i'd try to simplify it and didn't add the step to add the /prefix_test node and used the root node to GET the namespaces from. I'm not sure if this is correct or realistic.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
