      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I've added some of the information from <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1425\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1425</a> to the page. I wasn't sure what tone to use.</p>\n\n<p>Also, in the examples from PR, it uses /rest/prefix_test but I thought i'd try to simplify it and didn't add the step to add the /prefix_test node and used the root node to GET the namespaces from. I'm not sure if this is correct or realistic.</p>",
     "created": "09/Oct/18 5:01 PM",
