      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" data-account-id=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" accountid=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Danny Bernstein</a> reviewed and edited the text</p>\n\n<p>I tested the example code to check that it worked. There was an issue with the PUT command so I used the PUT command <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" data-account-id=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" accountid=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Ben Pennell</a> used in the PR</p>",
     "created": "10/Oct/18 5:18 PM",
