      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The documentation looks good... and works.<br/>\nThere was a good recommendation in Slack today about:<br/>\n&gt; keeping the entry on the inventory page very brief and linking out to the full description on another page</p>\n\n<p>I would second this suggestion. A potential landing page for the details is here:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Best+Practices+-+RDF+Namespaces\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Best+Practices+-+RDF+Namespaces</a></p>",
     "created": "10/Oct/18 7:58 PM",
